  "summary": "World Action Models (WAMs) unify future video prediction with action generation for robotic control, offering efficient deployment by scaling up from single observation to up to five minutes of history and adapting pretraining to large-scale robot datasets. DriftWAM and G0.7 represent a new paradigm in refining WAMs for practical applications.",
